 "hypotheses": [
  "cwt_n_cycles = freqs/7 makes sigma_t = 1/(14 pi) ~ 0.023 samples so every Morlet wavelet is one sample long (constant 1.414): the 'CWT' is the raw signal; with a single epoch coh = plv = 1, ppc and pli2_unbiased divide by zero, wpli2_debiased = 0 (tests/README flagged)",
  "statistic over frequency AND time; pyspi mirrors lower->upper triangle",
  "mt_adaptive is unused in cwt mode"
 ],
